    "body": "Returned-test root cause found: installed build E3CAD... was a release build and the prior camera editor inherited the global developer-mode gate, so its input path was unreachable. Integration will not enable every unrelated development tool. The camera editor now has its own release-build tilde latch; global F2/F3 authoring paths remain compiled out. Remains actionable until rebuilt/installed and tilde/keypad/Numpad0 behavior is visible in game.",
